## The reading room

::bg{location="library" time="night"}
::auto{character="soren" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@soren{code="0010" emotion="sad"}: My exchange ends with the term. They're sending me home. I'm a library book, and I'm overdue.
@soren{code="0020" emotion="fond" when="holds('cleared', ['soren', 'bittersweet'])"}: I dreamt I left, once. You waved from the ferry dock. I've been afraid of ferries ever since.
@soren{code="0030" emotion="shy" when="run.exam == 'top'"}: You took my rank on the midterm. I've never been so happy to lose anything.

<branch id="sorenAsk" prompt="Soren holds out a return slip with nothing written on it.">
  <choice id="write" label="Write your address on it">
    @soren{code="0040" emotion="happy"}: Then I'm not overdue. I'm on loan. That's — that's much better.
    ::set{run.aff.soren += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="keep" label="Keep the slip blank, as a souvenir">
    @soren{code="0050" emotion="sad"}: Oh. A souvenir. Yes. Of course.
    ::set{run.aff.soren -= 1}
  </choice>
</branch>
